            <div xml:id="m-13be1381-841b-4818-ae70-aa95383a2c11">
              <lg xml:id="m-4781cac4-847c-4e46-bc5e-4209c69fa256">
                <l xml:id="m-05cd8c03-6aeb-4db9-a89c-7fb39e30f1ea" facs="#m-b081c365-7608-4740-b496-dc2166be93cd" label="text-like">Ist Sunday oi Lent.</l><l xml:id="m-363f8b79-0454-4bfe-b43b-db237faee903" facs="#m-79c49a7d-eccb-43ec-9c27-c42c138065da" label="ambiguous">537</l><l xml:id="m-4ce3a2ec-ebb7-42a6-abcd-7474f871f970" facs="#m-fa18498f-8309-46f9-920a-ccce2e225cd4" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Matthaeum. Matth. 4.</l><l xml:id="m-eb1336e3-a1c4-4a04-9099-cfeb3facd1ca" facs="#m-1a58fc2c-db4a-42d0-8371-4f3b932288e1" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Ductus est Jesus de te, et in mánibus tollent te, ne</l><l xml:id="m-4154d35d-64f2-4157-967c-2557567ae47b" facs="#m-1ee1a81f-961c-41aa-a208-d4fb0416fc97" label="lyrics-like">I in desértum a Spíritu, ut tenta¬</l><l xml:id="m-b25bb4ef-fb36-47b3-b0df-ca21b415c3ff" facs="#m-28f2d630-e9e5-4676-af0a-9ee7fa50bda1" label="lyrics-like">forte offéndas ad lápidem pedem</l><l xml:id="m-b3409bbd-3f98-4bd7-bd99-75147d745680" facs="#m-aa224bda-0b4a-418b-a9e2-0eaf91558cd6" label="lyrics-like">rétur a diábolo. Et cum jejunásset</l><l xml:id="m-e7509397-a31b-4ee9-b50b-9fbd7cac0b4e" facs="#m-718c63c8-8aa4-4134-b340-1f0d73754515" label="ambiguous">tuum. Ait illi Jesus: Rursum scri¬</l><l xml:id="m-046a8c1d-68c0-44bf-8bc0-e75e4c757eca" facs="#m-174a273f-0dd8-4afa-b028-f2ee148c544d" label="lyrics-like">ptum est: Non tentábis Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-3df48ba1-2e01-4901-b188-ba7c6e610fd4" facs="#m-b977056b-83aa-4e34-b44c-455dc0aa4791" label="lyrics-like">quadraginta diébus, et quadraginta</l><l xml:id="m-018e347c-c1d5-4144-a1b7-e491cfb574ad" facs="#m-e433d25a-98d1-4f23-ab8f-a0e69bcd135d" label="lyrics-like">noctibus, póstea esúriit. Et accé¬</l><l xml:id="m-e1458dd6-84df-4de3-825b-f1d1045a25b0" facs="#m-52570727-0ee9-4514-b2d8-ef08713be021" label="lyrics-like">Deum tuum. Iterum assúmpsit eum</l><l xml:id="m-37b7248c-dd4a-484d-8189-7334c6960589" facs="#m-41c421ba-85e9-4bfa-bab5-dee9d1677df4" label="lyrics-like">dens tentátor, dixit ei : Si Fllius Dei</l><l xml:id="m-2a96f8ca-333e-4144-b5b1-2b2211b73d62" facs="#m-86f1fc14-295e-44ab-82a3-834e365fa0d2" label="lyrics-like">diábolus in montem excélsum val¬</l><l xml:id="m-3bbb4896-7dcc-4fea-aefd-047785b776f6" facs="#m-64d8541d-93f6-4002-acdc-05c203222305" label="lyrics-like">es, dic ut lápides isti panes fiant.</l><l xml:id="m-7af6c866-c271-474d-8e93-0f66064e6349" facs="#m-a067ff7b-6f5b-4791-927a-d49e0e05b93f" label="lyrics-like">de: et osténdit ei ómnia regna</l><l xml:id="m-c9eb13dd-d0ad-43b1-953f-2ca40e805776" facs="#m-ad24f66f-4ca0-43ec-8196-340c391240a5" label="lyrics-like">Qui respóndens, dixit: Scriptum</l><l xml:id="m-2e2754fe-2f90-4a06-87f6-faaf77fe9626" facs="#m-cba1675b-3108-4a2e-9813-3bd4d2997d80" label="lyrics-like">mundi, et glóriam eórum, et dixit</l><l xml:id="m-fd2d411b-35b0-4216-8407-1c72fdf57406" facs="#m-6ad81e6c-eca3-4b1c-8da2-69398e39a802" label="ambiguous">est: Non in solo pane vivit homo,</l><l xml:id="m-e6b95d0e-5674-481e-a4a3-785d1b2f4616" facs="#m-6d7e7256-d67b-4359-b9dd-d983394fb9ea" label="lyrics-like">ei: Haec ómnia tibi dabo, si cadens</l><l xml:id="m-c77dc131-9ce7-46ca-a6ee-0834a059a0f5" facs="#m-ff654121-a03e-4b3d-981a-f4e3b3be2eab" label="lyrics-like">sed in omni verbo, quod procédit</l><l xml:id="m-a2f0d451-8427-4506-89a7-ef836b4a2c4f" facs="#m-ba68ec7f-7d73-4145-a22b-6c96d7842fa1" label="lyrics-like">adoráveris me. Tunc dicit ei Jesus:</l><l xml:id="m-35935049-e86a-4d92-b669-2708420fc699" facs="#m-cc50db9d-c1d3-4583-aea0-4135cd78ee19" label="lyrics-like">de ore Dei. Tunc assúmpsit eum</l><l xml:id="m-76334c3f-12ea-4448-9e7d-579a9ceea0e6" facs="#m-de60c66f-c602-4c6e-affd-e1b15997517d" label="lyrics-like">Vade Sátana: scriptum est enim:</l><l xml:id="m-85efb447-8a8b-43f6-896b-8f040969c95b" facs="#m-77cfcedc-aa59-4dc6-86d9-da4b4864a800" label="lyrics-like">diábolus in sanctam civitâtem, et</l><l xml:id="m-3529119e-cac7-4b23-8487-a580b53247f5" facs="#m-40b8326e-53ec-42b5-aac9-7046d1204e7d" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum Deum tuum adorábis: et</l><l xml:id="m-f343a43a-55ce-4652-aa74-5be3627d6bd6" facs="#m-4144de87-3208-43cf-bcfc-8738d90bb912" label="lyrics-like">státuit eum super pinnáculum tem¬</l><l xml:id="m-b03749cc-7dde-4d90-a728-a43fb8668c61" facs="#m-10a8fb5f-8020-449d-b4eb-1bd89a4aefa9" label="lyrics-like">illi soli sérvies. Tunc reliquit eum</l><l xml:id="m-d63f8670-7540-4f51-9baa-a6a4bbcad0ce" facs="#m-560e4684-b3d5-4645-986d-959115453979" label="ambiguous">pli, et dixit ei: Si Fllius Dei es,</l><l xml:id="m-11b3b201-290b-46f9-be4c-7a1d2489dc06" facs="#m-e8320979-9da3-4b58-9f15-6af59faa3a65" label="lyrics-like">diábolus: et ecce Angeli accessé¬</l><l xml:id="m-f7febca3-a215-474d-a727-aefeded17d60" facs="#m-44063654-c604-474e-8b9c-ed35b134b453" label="lyrics-like">mitte te deórsum. Scriptum est runt, et ministrábant ei. Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-453b71e7-2935-4f9f-be0c-a2d147f2555e" facs="#m-3ae8db77-c294-4cd5-b659-691c694819d1" label="lyrics-like">enim: Quia Angelis suis mandávit!</l><l xml:id="m-67e3392a-ddbd-4a8e-9fd1-cfe6df35e8c0" facs="#m-b225db75-d9a2-4eb5-8faa-88cb5f44140b" label="ambiguous">orert.!</l><l xml:id="m-4a2bca7a-9dbf-4764-b9e8-8b2996ef2e9e" facs="#m-8539062d-6953-4514-9e46-407f30dbeee4" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-87e35452-d116-4382-acf2-f3f9786562cb" facs="#m-70643a6b-6114-42cb-9f27-275654d6bd16" label="lyrics-like">OCápu-lis sú- is “obumbrá-bit tí-bi Dómi-nus,</l><l xml:id="m-e7658925-f35e-4749-bd9b-c52c117c65fa" facs="#m-bfbf7ce5-50fd-4d19-abb2-e6b1f45f447a" label="lyrics-like">bis : scú- to</l><l xml:id="m-36ac3d38-a4f8-4590-97a3-715ce88ce3c6" facs="#m-c2ea6aa2-9776-4592-8637-0571cf0a90dc" label="lyrics-like">et sub pén-nis éjus</l><l xml:id="m-6d514c96-31d7-42fb-80a5-e2454bf3b285" facs="#m-d7be22b7-16a2-41b6-b94c-470a1ea080ea" label="lyrics-like">spe-rá¬</l><l xml:id="m-53d1bb5d-9757-4cef-bddf-a3ee6612a527" facs="#m-d8267ccf-c3fa-4cb9-8351-8ee9d8e9036e" label="lyrics-like">ri-tas é- jus.</l><l xml:id="m-e4161958-da5a-49e3-bc55-5d1740ae7458" facs="#m-1722d9f5-9094-42be-9a13-fdcc182b91df" label="lyrics-like">circúmda- bit te</l><l xml:id="m-8dd27e1f-3840-417e-839c-b3398bc024c2" facs="#m-43950e70-1e88-4775-a859-eb5f3e7543a9" label="lyrics-like">vé¬</l><l xml:id="m-e8184838-396a-42fe-902f-fd6cdeab7b1e" facs="#m-57ba9755-e2a5-4ef0-9a7b-3f2524b5ae57" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-5aa4f206-4c46-4f47-83b1-8d60d08abd05" facs="#m-0cb5496c-7f92-425d-bf35-54732d48bd89" label="lyrics-like">YAcrificium quadragesimális int-] lárum restrictióne carnálium, a nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-b9b8adff-929f-443f-8548-2ccd060e453e" facs="#m-8c88cd42-d8f0-4c17-9498-8f53027697f3" label="lyrics-like">O tii solémniter immolámus, te,</l><l xml:id="m-c5e60732-54db-4c01-95dc-b1482a85b08a" facs="#m-c5153daa-77a6-47a9-b9ee-c800b82fe1ff" label="lyrics-like">xiis quoque voluptátibus temperé¬</l><l xml:id="m-fef846b9-5be8-491a-a3b1-e8b149a1a71a" facs="#m-7f452f57-16e9-41e3-b868-51834cdcc95a" label="lyrics-like">Dómine, deprecántes : ut cum epu-lmus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-db1c348a-fec3-41b5-9f76-e8308c566a29" facs="#m-f0bd243c-bc1f-4f45-9434-7734aaf50990" label="lyrics-like">and Secret: Exáudi nos. P. 501. 3rd. Deus, cui soli. p. 529.</l><l xml:id="m-0883374f-2c49-465d-9751-197de74d1567" facs="#m-92829341-48ea-41dd-823f-62459b58a112" label="ambiguous">comm.E</l><l xml:id="m-5e98f841-505c-4560-a8a2-a14fb01d0e2a" facs="#m-bebf9363-d5d0-4a4b-b28e-4f3ea65d4e61" label="ambiguous">3.</l><l xml:id="m-6da8a6e2-3090-4cf4-9ab7-cb3a4b6d8696" facs="#m-f8b28157-1ec2-406d-9216-6656adaa4caa" label="lyrics-like">obumbrá- bit tí¬ bi,</l><l xml:id="m-9be54e38-2e96-484b-bd97-520106c7bc71" facs="#m-a3b8edd5-d480-49fe-be8d-723af2ca0032" label="lyrics-like">DCá-pu-lis sú¬</l><l xml:id="m-823964de-08c8-4690-971a-54123dcfbca6" facs="#m-47bdcccf-e4f3-4945-9b78-994b5de42284" label="text-like">is</l><l xml:id="m-9c086200-8ea7-44eb-ba59-874585616d3a" facs="#m-70249b41-d33d-4f5d-85b7-554bf89ff7b4" label="ambiguous">et</l><l xml:id="m-70a167b6-4541-4ad9-8af2-8f64428cc76e" facs="#m-e05ab282-ef88-4987-be04-3ea27b06288c" label="lyrics-like">rá- bis:</l><l xml:id="m-6059de28-3841-4033-b13f-1dd4f7d504b6" facs="#m-c4fe63a3-02d0-4868-9256-53e9ccce538a" label="lyrics-like">sub pén- nis é-jus spe¬</l><l xml:id="m-5b81785f-36a0-4820-b1f7-93b20c0d75d2" facs="#m-1225658d-022f-4cb6-b34d-643c25b422cd" label="lyrics-like">scú¬</l><l xml:id="m-b839bfce-b178-4d19-8595-5d8dbbb2a304" facs="#m-0838cad5-8fee-45f1-aa85-1d1c081a68ce" label="ambiguous">cir¬</l><l xml:id="m-c47b02dc-762e-4d8b-b02f-ec0943e04fad" facs="#m-03e5c444-672c-4652-9faa-6ac30d8b50b8" label="ambiguous">to</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>